docs/research/1921-queue-arm-gate/codex-plan-r1.log:1388:./_Log.md:5565:  **Action**: #1895 engineered to MERGE-READY as PR #1899 (probe-pin install failures → ErrProbeSetup hold-state instead of false PASS; per-pin install results + rollback, union pre-hold across band reprogram, publish-after-Apply, hash-gated retry, xpf_rpm_probe_pin_install_failures gauge). 4 Codex rounds (2 MAJOR traces fixed: full-apply old-marks race, no-installer release-before-drain), live validated on loss userspace cluster (held state + retry recovery + counterfactual ping). Copilot quota-blocked (3 documented retries); AGY OAuth-expired (2 attempts).
