   142	| `pkg/dataplane/` | Runtime contracts, retained userspace shim embed/loader, eBPF/DPDK retirement-error sentinels (#1476/#1525) |
   143	| `pkg/dataplane/userspace/` | Go manager for the Rust userspace dataplane |
   144	| `userspace-xdp/` | Retained Rust XDP shim that redirects packets into the AF_XDP userspace runtime |
   145	| `userspace-dp/` | Rust AF_XDP userspace dataplane binary |
   146	| `pkg/daemon/` | Daemon lifecycle, reconciliation, interface management |
   147	| `pkg/cluster/` | Chassis cluster HA (state machine, session sync, config sync, IPsec SA sync) |
   148	| `pkg/vrrp/` | Native VRRPv3 state machine (30ms RETH advertisements) |
