   105	### CONFIRMED root cause of the EBUSY loop (AGY r3, verified in code)
   106	
   107	The rebind recovery path bypasses the very quiesce that exists to prevent this
   108	EBUSY. `rebind::handle` (`userspace-dp/src/server/handlers/rebind.rs:16`) calls
   109	`guard.afxdp.stop()` — which clears `coord.workers.handles` — *before*
   110	`reconcile_status_bindings` → `tear_down`. Inside `tear_down`
   111	(`coordinator/reconcile/teardown.rs:14`), `had_live_workers =
   112	!coord.workers.handles.is_empty()` therefore evaluates **false**, so the
   113	`thread::sleep(500ms)` quiesce at `teardown.rs:44-46` — whose comment says it
