   157	## 5. Concrete design — phased, minimal-first
   158	
   159	**The committed fix is small and proven; everything else is contingent.** The
   160	EBUSY loop's engine is code-verified (§3, both reviewers): `rebind::handle`
   161	double-stops workers, bypassing `tear_down`'s 500ms ZC-teardown quiesce. The
   162	plan therefore commits to that one fix and validates it before doing anything
   163	larger:
   164	
   165	- **Phase 0 — instrument + repro (mandatory first).** On a virtio multi-queue
   166	  venue, confirm the outage and capture per-queue bind outcome + the full ctrl
   167	  state machine (§9), proving the rebind→quiesce-bypass→EBUSY loop is the live
   168	  cause.
