   172	  tunnel-owner remap blinding, §3). Re-test on virtio. **Expected sufficient on
   173	  its own:** once all RX queues bind cleanly, `queue_count == actual queue
   174	  count` (identity modulo), every queue goes READY, and forwarding works — there
